<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria's UAC half year profit.</title>
<headline>Nigeria's UAC half year profit.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year result for conglomerate UAC Nigeria Plc to end-June.</p>
<p>(In million naira)</p>
<p>					     1996	1995</p>
<p>Turnover				  5,200    4,200</p>
<p>Profit before tax</p>
<p>     and minority interest	    349.8    450.5</p>
<p>Taxation				    104.9    166.7</p>
<p>Minority interest			 100.3     55.1</p>
<p>Profit after tax</p>
<p>    and minority interest	     144.6    228.8</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
